<div class="compact-home"><section class="compact-mission" aria-labelledby="home-title"><div class="mission-headline"><svg class="mission-neighbor-icon" viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><circle cx="18" cy="10" r="3"/><path d="m17 17 1 12h12l6 11m-18-17h10M13 25a10 10 0 1 0 13 13"/><circle cx="35" cy="12" r="3"/><path d="M29 23v-2a6 6 0 0 1 12 0v9m-6-7v17m-6-17-5 3"/></svg><h1 id="home-title">Neighbors helping <span>Neighbors</span></h1><svg class="mission-neighbor-icon" viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><circle cx="18" cy="10" r="3"/><path d="m17 17 1 12h12l6 11m-18-17h10M13 25a10 10 0 1 0 13 13"/><circle cx="35" cy="12" r="3"/><path d="M29 23v-2a6 6 0 0 1 12 0v9m-6-7v17m-6-17-5 3"/></svg></div><p class="compact-summary">FreeDME connects people to give, lend, and receive free mobility equipment, helping those in need while keeping equipment in use.</p><div class="actions"><button class="primary" data-action="browse" data-id="">Find free equipment →</button><button class="" data-action="donate" data-id="">Give or lend equipment</button></div><p class="compact-access">For every age and income · No insurance paperwork · Caregivers welcome</p></section><section class="compact-process" aria-labelledby="process-title"><div class="compact-section-heading"><h2 id="process-title"><svg class="process-heading-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="3" width="6" height="6" rx="1"/><rect x="15" y="15" width="6" height="6" rx="1"/><path d="M9 6h6a3 3 0 0 1 3 3v3m-3-3 3 3 3-3M15 18H9a3 3 0 0 1-3-3v-3m3 3-3-3-3 3"/></svg><span>How it works</span></h2><a class="" href="/how-it-works">View the full process →</a></div><ol class="compact-workflow"><li><span class="compact-number" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div><h3>Find or offer <span class="workflow-next-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span></h3><p>Browse free gifts and loans, or list equipment to share.</p></div></li><li><span class="compact-number" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div><h3>Request & verify <span class="workflow-next-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span></h3><p>Request an item, then verify your identity and address.</p></div></li><li><span class="compact-number" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div><h3>Approve <span class="workflow-next-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span></h3><p>After donor approval, accept the offer and agree on pickup.</p></div></li><li><span class="compact-number" aria-hidden="true">4</span><div><h3>Confirm handoff</h3><p>Either person confirms handoff; donors confirm loan returns.</p></div></li></ol></section><div class="compact-trust-pair"><section class="compact-safety" aria-labelledby="safe-title"><h2 id="safe-title"><span class="safe-shield"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m12 3 8 3v6c0 5-8 9-8 9s-8-4-8-9V6l8-3Z"/><path d="m8 12 3 3 5-6"/></svg></span><span>Safe Handoff</span></h2><p>Meet in a public, nonresidential place during daylight opening hours and check condition and fit before accepting. FreeDME does not inspect equipment or arrange transport.</p><div class="compact-limits"><a class="" href="/how-it-works#handoff">Safety & pickup guidance →</a></div></section><section class="compact-security" aria-labelledby="security-title"><h2 id="security-title"><svg class="security-heading-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="5" y="10" width="14" height="11" rx="2"/><path d="M8 10V7a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v3"/><circle cx="12" cy="15" r="1"/><path d="M12 16v2"/></svg><span>Easy &amp; Secure</span></h2><p>Easy to signup. No email address or other personal information is required. All we need is your mobile phone number and verified location (zipcode/town). All communication between you and your neighbor remain private.</p><div class="security-link"><a class="" href="/how-it-works#protection">How we plan to protect the community →</a></div></section></div><section class="compact-share" aria-labelledby="share-teaser-title"><div><h2 id="share-teaser-title"><svg class="share-heading-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="18" cy="5" r="3"/><circle cx="6" cy="12" r="3"/><circle cx="18" cy="19" r="3"/><path d="m8.6 10.5 6.8-4m-6.8 7 6.8 4"/></svg><span>Share the idea. Keep the good going.</span></h2><p>No equipment to share? Help someone find a free gift or loan with our ready-to-copy text and email drafts.</p><p class="share-note">You send from your own app. FreeDME never needs your contacts.</p></div><button class="" data-action="share-drafts" data-id="">Spread the word →</button></section></div>